  "effect_entries": [],
  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "text": "ひとが　おうに　けんじょうしていた　タヅナ。\nほうじょうの　ちからを　ぞうふくし\nバドレックスと　あいばを　がったい　させる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "인간들이 왕에게 바친 고삐.\n풍요의 힘을 증폭시켜서\n버드렉스와 애마를 합체시킨다.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "過去曾由人們獻給國王的韁繩。\n能夠增強豐饒之力，\n使蕾冠王與愛馬合體。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Une offrande des humains au roi. Ces rênes permettent\nd’unir Sylveroy à son fidèle destrier, et renforcent son\nhabilité à prodiguer d’abondantes récoltes.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Zügel, die dem König vom Volk dargeboten wurden.\nSie verstärken Coronospas Macht über reiche Ernten\nund ermöglichen das Bündnis mit seinem treuen Ross.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Riendas que se entregaron como ofrenda al rey.\nPotencian los poderes de Calyrex para mejorar las\ncosechas y le permiten unirse con su amado corcel.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Briglie offerte in dono al re dagli esseri umani.\nAmplificano il potere di Calyrex di donare prosperità\ne gli permettono di unirsi al suo destriero.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Reins that people presented to the king. They enhance\nCalyrex’s power over bountiful harvests and unite\nCalyrex with its beloved steed.",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "人が　王に　献上していた　タヅナ。\n豊穣の力を　増幅し\nバドレックスと　愛馬を　合体させる。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "人们曾经用来进献给国王的缰绳。\n可增强丰饶之力，\n并使蕾冠王与爱马合二为一。",
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      },
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hans",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/12/"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Riendas que se entregaron como ofrenda al rey.\nPotencian los poderes de Calyrex para mejorar las\ncosechas y le permiten unirse con su amado corcel.",
      "version_group": {
